---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Gestalt Psychotherapy in Kathmandu, Nepal" 
  description="Gestalt psychotherapy in Kathmandu: an experiential therapy built on awareness, choice and present-moment experience. How it works and how to begin."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">Clinical Practice</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Gestalt Psychotherapy in Kathmandu, Nepal</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Gestalt psychotherapy is an experiential, humanistic therapy. Instead of only talking about the past, it helps you notice what is happening in you right now: your feelings, body sensations, thoughts and the way you relate to others. That awareness is the starting point for change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">The core ideas</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Awareness:</strong> Paying attention to your present experience often shows patterns you did not know you had.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact and relationship:</strong> We form who we are in relation to other people, so therapy looks at how you connect, and where you pull away.</li>
          <li><strong>Here and now:</strong> Past events matter, but we explore how they live on in your body, emotions and behaviour today.</li>
          <li><strong>Unfinished business:</strong> Feelings left unexpressed, such as grief, anger or hurt, can keep shaping the present until acknowledged.</li>
          <li><strong>Responsibility and choice:</strong> The aim is to see your options more clearly and choose.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What sessions can look like</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Sessions are one-to-one, about one hour, and led at a pace you can manage. Your therapist may invite you to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Notice and describe what you feel in your body as you speak</li>
          <li>Try a short "experiment", for example saying aloud what you have never said</li>
          <li>Explore a dream, an image or a relationship pattern</li>
          <li>Practise a new response and then reflect on it</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">You can say no to any invitation, and nothing happens without your consent.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">Who it may help</h2>
        <p>Gestalt therapy is often chosen by people who feel stuck, disconnected from their feelings, caught in repeating relationship patterns, or carrying grief or unresolved experiences. It can be used alongside other approaches such as CBT or hypnotherapy.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-8 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">Is Gestalt therapy only about the present?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">No. We use the present as the doorway to the past, looking at how earlier experiences affect you now.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">How is it different from CBT?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">CBT mainly works on thoughts and behaviours with set techniques. Gestalt works more through awareness, relationship and experience in the moment. Some people benefit from a combination.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">If you would like to explore Gestalt psychotherapy, request a consultation.</h2>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>